22\uc2 Japan intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  intermittently in dollar/yen from around 110.50 on Thursday, raising speculating Japan is determined to prevent the dollar's recovery from faltering.   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020040306e035003ve\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
