\par\par \b \uc2 Japan Tanigaki: Japan Econ Sensitive To Sudden  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  Moves  \b0\par\par\uc2 196 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2004\par 07:37\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 TOKYO (Dow Jones)--Japan's Finance Minister Tuesday justified Tokyo's efforts to curb the yen's rise by saying \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is necessary at times given the economy's sensitivity to rapid \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market movements.  \par \par \uc2 "As a country which is involved in trading, we tend to be easily influenced by \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  fluctuations," Sadakazu Tanigaki told a Parliamentary committee.  \par \par \uc2 "When there are rapid movements we need to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," Tanigaki said, when questioned about Tokyo's unprecedented yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  since last year.  \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  said last week the government sold Y3.342 trillion in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets in February to fight the yen's rise.  \par \par \uc2 February's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which followed record sales of Y7.155 trillion in January, brings the total spent since the start of 2003 to a stunning Y30.554 trillion.  \par \par \uc2 Japan maintains \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates should move stably in reflection of fundamentals, Tanigaki added, and that stable \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  are beneficial not only to Japan, but to other countries.  \par \par \uc2 -By Miyako Takebe, Dow Jones Newswires; 813-5255-2929; miyako.takebe@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 -Edited by John Gibson [ 02-03-04 0654GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020040302e0320006t\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
