\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 4-Japan sees  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\uc2  market moving towards stability.  \b0\par\par\uc2 By Tamawa Kadoya  \par \uc2 493 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Februar 2004\par 11:07\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 TOKYO, Feb 26 (Reuters) - Japan's top financial diplomat said on Thursday the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market was heading towards stability over the medium term, a key goal of Japanese authorities concerned about the effect on exporters of volatile rates.  \par \par \uc2 A reversal of short dollar positions was continuing and a trend was becoming established, Zembei Mizoguchi, vice finance minister for international affairs, told reporters.  \par \par \uc2 "It is gradually firming," he said. "We will watch the market carefully for when the tide turns."  \par \par \uc2 The dollar hit a three-month high around 109.65 yen on Thursday.  \par \par \uc2 Bank of Japan Governor Toshihiko Fukui also expressed satisfaction with the recent trend, saying investors seemed to better understand government's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  policies since the Group of Seven (G7) met in early February.  \par \par \uc2 "We see that the market has gained a better understanding of the governments' policies, which is that \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  moves should reflect fundamentals and that excessive volatility is not desirable for the economy," he said.  \par \par \uc2 The G7 statement said excessive volatility and disorderly movements in exchange rates were undesirable for economic growth.  \par \par \uc2 That was seen by some as a policy victory for Japanese authorities, who had repeatedly called for stability due to concern about the effects volatile moves have on the nation's exporters, the main drivers of an economic recovery.  \par \par \uc2 They have not flinched from taking action, selling a record 20 trillion yen ($183.6 billion) last year to curb the yen's rise, followed by a monthly record of over seven trillion yen in January.  \par \par \uc2 Some market participants suspect \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  has grown to 10 trillion yen so far this year.  \par \par \uc2 Both Mizoguchi and Finance Minister Sadakazu Tanigaki reiterated their views on the need for \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Thursday, saying International Monetary Fund head Horst Koehler had expressed understanding for the policy.  \par \par \uc2 "Instability in \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  is a big obstacle, especially when we are trying to overcome deflation, so that's why we are \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  when there are sudden moves," Tanigaki told a parliamentary committee.  \par \par \uc2 "Mr. Koehler shares the same understanding with us on this issue," he said, adding in a later comment that Japan would act appropriately when needed in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets but was not looking to fix the yen at a set exchange rate.  \par \par \uc2 Koehler said in Tokyo on Wednesday that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  was appropriate given a lack of other policy tools to reflate its economy, but that he understood it was a temporary measure.  \par \par \uc2 Mizoguchi declined to comment on a Market News International report citing unnamed sources as saying the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  would be ready to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , if needed, to slow the euro's rise against the dollar.  \par \par \uc2 "We are always in touch with our counterparts, but as for \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , I won't comment," he said.  \par \par \uc2 The ECB had also declined to comment on the report. ($1=108.92 yen) (Additional reporting by Chisa Fujioka).   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020040226e02q0005r\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
