\par\par \b \uc2 Mizoguchi: No Comment On Any Possible  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  Action With ECB  \b0\par\par\uc2 428 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Februar 2004\par 01:46\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 TOKYO (Dow Jones)--Japan's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  point-man Thursday declined to comment on the possibility of joint \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  with the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 "We don't comment on \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said Zembei Mizoguchi, vice finance minister for international affairs, when asked about overnight media reports that the ECB may be mulling asking Japan to help stem the euro's rise. [ 26-02-04 0059GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 The dollar posted a strong recovery Wednesday, as fears of European action to counter euro strength prompted short-term investors to dump the single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 Market News International Wednesday cited unnamed sources from the ECB as saying the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was prepared to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets in concert with the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken the euro. The report also said the ECB would discuss cutting interest rates at its next meeting on March 4.  \par \par \uc2 Mizoguchi welcomed the dollar's rally, saying that recent adjustments of short-dollar positions, which are helping lift the greenback, were now in a "firm trend" - something which is desirable for stabilizing the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.  \par \par \uc2 Mizoguchi also said that comments Wednesday by the head of the International Monetary Fund, who backed \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  as being an "appropriate" and a "pragmatic" way to fight deflation, showed understanding of Tokyo's economic policies.  \par \par \uc2 IMF Managing Director Horst Koehler told a press conference that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was an effective deflation-fighting tool given the lack of other monetary policy options. He added that he believed \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is being used primarily as an adjunct of monetary policy, rather than as a trade weapon, and that it was likely only "temporary."  \par \par \uc2 "The IMF has long said that monetary easing is important for Japan overcoming deflation," Mizoguchi said.  \par \par \uc2 "So for us, the comments weren't particularly new ... but they do show that our policies are being understood."  \par \par \uc2 Mizoguchi said that Japan's economic recovery is highly important for the rest of the world, but Tokyo currently has little room to maneuver in terms of fiscal or monetary policy.  \par \par \uc2 His comments suggest the government will continue to utilize \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  as a means of ensuring the economic recovery continues, especially in the wake of the endorsement from the IMF.  \par \par \uc2 Tokyo has drawn criticism from some of Japan's trade partners for weighing the yen down with more than Y27 trillion in market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  since the start of 2003.  \par \par \uc2 -By Miyako Takebe, Dow Jones Newswires; 813-5255-2929; miyako.takebe@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    -Edited by Alastair Gale and Bennett Richardson \par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 [ 26-02-04 0150GMT ]  \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020040226e02q00010\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clv